{"ID":"20240511110534-799q3yo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110534-799q3yo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110534-799q3yo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511115006-7pupe17\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511132807-a5au0l8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511132807-4c5altr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:7,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-059号（喷耳鼻,药粉）","type":"doc","updated":"20240511132817"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511115006-7pupe17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511115006-7pupe17","updated":"20240511115006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此药粉是针对鼻炎过敏 , 耳流脓 , 病人昏迷不醒而设计的 , 属於外用喷剂 , 有许多病人使用此药一日一次 , 一星期後不药而愈 , 这类型是一般的鼻炎 , 如果严重的话 , 一日可以用三次 , 配合HT-39或HT-81使用 , 一定会好转的 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511115006-f5gg3gi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511115006-f5gg3gi","updated":"20240511115011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳朵流脓是无法用抗生素治疗的 , 尤其常见於小孩身上 , 使用此药粉喷入耳中 , 一日二次 , 使耳中保持乾燥 , 自然就好了 , 治疗时间长短 , 就看各人病情不同而定 . 严重的病人请跟我们的医师联络 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511115006-tem24t4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511115006-tem24t4","updated":"20240511115013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人不明原因的昏迷 , 无论是高血压或心脏病 , 中风或意外车祸等 , 也可以使用此药粉喷入鼻中 , 由於其开脑窍 , 刺激鼻窦的力量很强 , 一般来说都会立刻醒来 , 建议有不明原因的昏迷 , 应该到医院检查 , 有很多情形 , 西医查不出来 , 就应该找高明的中医来查 , 我就有几次碰到病人有此症状 , 而医院完全不知病人为何会如此 , 而由我查出问题所在 , 任何病兆 , 必然有所原因造成 ,"}]},{"ID":"20240511115006-5214h31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511115006-5214h31","updated":"20240511115006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"千万不可以因为医院告知不明原因而满足 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511115006-p35hke3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511115006-p35hke3","updated":"20240511115020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方内容 : 矾石 , …….."}]},{"ID":"20240511115006-w7o2qzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511115006-w7o2qzl","updated":"20240511115021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁 忌 : 常常流鼻血的病人 , 不可使用 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511115006-nuzuu5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511115006-nuzuu5w","updated":"20240511115023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"副作用 : 无 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511132757-ni47c1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132757-ni47c1x"}},{"ID":"20240511132758-onlqhph","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511132758-onlqhph"}},{"ID":"20240511132807-4c5altr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511132807-4c5altr","updated":"20240511132817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-59  喷鼻(耳)药粉"}]},{"ID":"20240511132807-a5au0l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132807-a5au0l8","updated":"20240511132807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(此方剂未讲解)"}]}]}